{"body": "Turtle Mountain Band of Chippewa Indians Tribal Code Chapter 42.08 Crimes and Civil Sanctions 42.08.010 Criminal Offenses 42.08.020 Civil Actions and Liability 42.08.030 Civil Liability", "num": "42.08", "path": "library|Turtle Mountain Band of Chippewa Indians Tribal Code|42|42.08", "title": "Chapter 42.08 Crimes and Civil Sanctions", "url": "/us/nsn/tmchippewa/council/code/42.08"}
